<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Air 1st-half net up 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Singapore Air 1st-half net up 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>	   (millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    560.5  vs  522.7</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	    7.5  vs    7.5</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		  43.7  vs   40.8</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		   3.53 vs    3.37</p>
<p>    Total expenditure		     3.06 vs    2.84</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    467.6  vs  527.8</p>
<p>    Surplus on sale of aircraft*    122.7  vs   14.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			594.4  vs  543.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name Singapore Airlines Ltd.</p>
<p>* includes surplus on sale of spares</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
